      "step": "Step 1: New value = Original * (1 + 0.20) = 1.2 * Original.\nStep 2: Original = 43 / 1.2.\nStep 3: Original = 36.",
      "tech": "Base percentage scaling.",
      "formula": "X_0 = \\frac{X_{\\text{new}}}{1 + r}",
