      "topic_id": "quant_log",
      "topic": "Logarithms",
      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "q": "[Logarithms Advanced #4] From a group of 13 candidates representing different departments, in how many distinct ways can a committee of 2 delegates be selected without regard to rank or ordering?",
