      "q": "Solve the financial and commercial optimization problem:\nAt a cloud hosting provider, an enterprise hardware asset is acquired at a production cost of $1700. Management marks up the catalog price by 30%, and subsequently offers an authorized enterprise discount of 14%. What is the exact net profit percentage realized on the transaction?",
