      "e": "Cost Price (CP) = $1700. Marked Price (MP) = $1700 * (1 + 30/100) = $2210. Selling Price (SP) = $2210 * (1 - 14/100) = $1900. Net profit % = ((1900 - 1700) / 1700) * 100 = 11.76%.",
