      "step": "Step 1: Formula nCr = n! / [r! (n-r)!].\nStep 2: Here n = 13, r = 2.\nStep 3: 13C2 = (13 * 12) / 2 = 78.",
      "tech": "Subset combination principle.",
      "formula": "\\binom{n}{2} = \\frac{n(n - 1)}{2}",
      "code": ""
