      "h": "Find the cyclicity of the base and take the exponent modulo the period.",
      "e": "LCM(a, b) = (a * b) / GCD(a, b). GCD(210, 315) = 105. LCM = (210 * 315) / 105 = 630.",
      "step": "Step 1: Compute GCD(210, 315) = 105.\nStep 2: Multiply 210 by 315 and divide by 105.\nStep 3: LCM = 630.",
      "tech": "Euclidean GCD/LCM relationship.",
      "formula": "\\text{LCM}(a, b) = \\frac{a \\cdot b}{\\gcd(a, b)}",
      "code": ""
