      "e": "By Rule of Alligation:\n(Quantity of Cheaper) / (Quantity of Dearer) = (36 - 27) / (27 - 21) = 9 / 6 = 3 : 2.",
      "step": "Step 1: Identify Cheaper price C = 21, Dearer price D = 36, Mean price M = 27.\nStep 2: D - M = 36 - 27 = 9.\nStep 3: M - C = 27 - 21 = 6.\nStep 4: Required ratio = 9 : 6 = 3 : 2.",
