      "q": "Calculate the operational completion time under concurrent execution:\nTwo independent processing units (Node Alpha and Node Beta) handle batch workloads at a renewable solar microgrid. Working alone, Node Alpha processes a standard queue in 10 hours, while Node Beta requires 15 hours. If both processing nodes operate concurrently in parallel, how many hours will they take to complete the entire queue?",
