      "step": "Step 1: Compute individual processing hourly efficiencies: 1/10 and 1/15.\nStep 2: Sum concurrent throughput: 1/T = (10+15)/(10*15).\nStep 3: Invert for total time: T = 6.0 hours.",
      "tech": "Harmonic mean work throughput formula.",
      "formula": "T_{\\text{combined}} = \\frac{T_A \\cdot T_B}{T_A + T_B}",
