      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "q": "[Pipes and Cisterns Advanced #3] In what ratio must tea worth Rs. 21 per kg be mixed with tea worth Rs. 36 per kg so that the resulting mixture is worth Rs. 27 per kg?",
