      "step": "Step 1: Compute individual processing hourly efficiencies: 1/14 and 1/21.\nStep 2: Sum concurrent throughput: 1/T = (14+21)/(14*21).\nStep 3: Invert for total time: T = 8.4 hours.",
      "tech": "Harmonic mean work throughput formula.",
      "formula": "T_{\\text{combined}} = \\frac{T_A \\cdot T_B}{T_A + T_B}",
