      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "q": "[Calendars Advanced #5] Worker A can complete a project in 20 days, while Worker B alone requires 30 days. If they collaborate together for the first 2 days and then Worker A leaves, how many days will Worker B take alone to finish the remaining work?",
