      "q": "Calculate the geometric spatial dimension:\nTrigonometric Bilateral Observation #6: Two monitoring vehicles are positioned on opposite sides of a transmission tower of height 28 meters. The observed angles of elevation to the top of the tower are 30 degrees and 45 degrees respectively. Taking sqrt(3) = 1.732, what is the total ground distance separating the two vehicles?",
