      "topic_id": "quant_di_comp",
      "topic": "Data Comparison",
      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "q": "[Data Comparison Advanced #3] In what ratio must tea worth Rs. 21 per kg be mixed with tea worth Rs. 36 per kg so that the resulting mixture is worth Rs. 27 per kg?",
